  projects:
    - name: ResuMatch Pro — Rule-Based NLP ATS & Recruitment Intelligence Platform
      description: |
        Built a production-grade full-stack ATS (Applicant Tracking System)
        and Recruitment Intelligence Platform as a Final Year B.Tech IT
        project at GL Bajaj Institute of Technology and Management (GLBITM),
        Greater Noida. Architected and developed 210+ files across 16
        database tables, 16 JPA models, 16 repositories, 16 services,
        7 REST controllers, 14 utilities, 18 DTOs, 28 JavaScript modules,
        31 HTML pages, and complete Docker/Nginx DevOps configuration.
        Engineered a custom rule-based NLP engine (zero AI/ML libraries)
        with a 10-stage processing pipeline — Text Extraction,
        Normalization, Section Detection, Stopword Removal, Synonym
        Normalization, Skill Extraction, Action Verb Classification,
        Experience Estimation, Achievement Detection, and Contact
        Detection. Implemented a 6-category weighted scoring algorithm
        (100 points total) covering Keyword Match (30 pts), Skill
        Relevance (25 pts), Experience Quality (20 pts), Achievements
        & Impact (15 pts), Formatting & Structure (10 pts), and
        Education Match (5 pts). Added confidence-weighted keyword
        matching — Skills Section (1.0), Experience Section (0.85),
        Projects Section (0.75) — and dynamic rescoring that
        automatically updates all applicant scores when recruiters
        modify job requirements. Built a 500+ skill vocabulary across
        9 domains with 80+ synonym mappings. Implemented JWT dual-token
        authentication (15-minute access token + 7-day refresh token)
        with BCrypt-12 password hashing and Spring Security 6. Supported
        resume file parsing via Apache PDFBox and Apache POI. Deployed
        with Docker Compose and Nginx reverse proxy.
