    - name: Homyz — Real Estate Web Platform (Incapp Final Project)
      description: |
        Built a modern real estate web platform targeting Delhi NCR region
        covering Noida, Gurgaon, Greater Noida, Faridabad, and South Delhi.
        Implemented dynamic property filtering by category (Apartments,
        Villas, Houses, Penthouses) with smooth CSS fade transitions.
        Integrated Google Sheets API as a completely serverless backend
        for contact form lead storage — no server or backend required.
        Added WhatsApp floating CTA button, Google Maps embed, animated
        locality explorer section, favorites system with heart animation,
        toast notification system, and animated counter statistics.
        Built with AOS scroll animations, custom scrollbar styling,
        and a fully mobile-first responsive design. Delivered as the
        Final Project of the Web Development course at Incapp IT
        Training Institute.
